# Silas wakes up captive in the Underground Guild (Milestone 20d, escape
# start). Plays once, the first time the Guild loads on Silas's game.

wait 0.6
emote player ...
narrate Dripping stone. Lamp smoke. Somewhere close, dice rattle across a table - and stop.
face player left
wait 0.4
face player right
wait 0.4
face player down
say Silas: The Guild's own cellars. I used to run jobs out of these tunnels. Now they've got me locked in one.
say Silas: They took the knives from my belt... and missed the one in my boot. Sloppy. The old Guild would never.
narrate From deeper in the tunnels comes a muffled voice, calling for help.
